{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5f/t1fdiseqvyin4q1cgiv9u1cn74n6qt0.mp3","text":"老板，要我做点夜宵吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_272_strong/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d8/q5gyuzvap7wl4te2v0ok85zxzy3m5wy.mp3","text":"老板，你要的。还有这个，你之前提过......大家都说我记忆力很好，不过我没什么感觉。","alt":"voice_cn/char_272_strong/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/80/jiz3qhe8x88wzulejnbnbym93gpymza.mp3","text":"我没事的时候，会研究厨艺......不止是海鲜。老板喜欢吃什么吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_272_strong/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/09/24qft3as7cyoc7lixim2dk8tvxdt6kh.mp3","text":"......老板，难道说，一般需要由我来找话题吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_272_strong/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a5/m099aikora2923jg5iviotulju6c7o5.mp3","text":"老板，你要去龙门夜市的话，我可以带路。那里很热闹，就是不太安全。","alt":"voice_cn/char_272_strong/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/94/qwz6b9wj676r8re4lwmlbye1asjnqyo.mp3","text":"凯尔希大姐特别允许我用罗德岛的渠道来进货，可以尝试一些新东西。老板，有什么特别的要求吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_272_strong/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:6/65/rp1tn61trc4s5l8y0o1gmtj4sne9wjb.mp3","text":"过去，因为一点原因，我一直被星熊警官盯着......不过，我知道，她和街坊的叔叔婶婶们一样，都是真心为我好。","alt":"voice_cn/char_272_strong/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/9e/0guno445irric05p6ohwf0dp3795lmu.mp3","text":"有人说，以我的刀功和记忆力，还有长相，天生就适合做恶人。我不喜欢，但也不知道怎么办......不过来到罗德岛后，我逐渐知道了，我只要做我想做的事就好。","alt":"voice_cn/char_272_strong/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/3c/4j9y7ensnhcbf6k26f22ehmenxtclt2.mp3","text":"老板，你觉得，我的记忆力有什么能派上用场的地方吗......以前我从没想过，但是现在，我想，要是能帮上忙就好了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_272_strong/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:6/65/fvybxytzvpg2z6ulag47vb8ykosulmw.mp3","text":"老......啊，睡着了，那我继续看书。","alt":"voice_cn/char_272_strong/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a7/1o0iqpt0zaxhrzgxn6bjoixluy7i9tm.mp3","text":"老板好，我叫孑。星熊警官说我更适合在这里做事，我就来了。我懂水产，会做菜，刀功也还可以，应该能帮上忙。","alt":"voice_cn/char_272_strong/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ea/2v5u712tts36lgfz1smysme76epdiut.mp3","text":"原来如此，战斗和做菜，也差不多。","alt":"voice_cn/char_272_strong/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:3/35/cdf7jwls7tk6xi5jrmtk0s02sk48msm.mp3","text":"老板，这是说，我能把摊开大点的意思吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_272_strong/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:d/dd/sjn1by9vnhkfbzsn7yy2pjtyt2hsx2t.mp3","text":"老板，我发现，把敌人当食材来看待的话，战斗也挺简单的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_272_strong/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:0/08/jubf85w9oy8r50git9z9p3g482cyjat.mp3","text":"啊，忘了收摊......","alt":"voice_cn/char_272_strong/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:5/52/t7l70norosx5oobpeg1bkr4w4v0wwgm.mp3","text":"带队叉鱼的话，我熟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_272_strong/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:d/de/oda4a87tlpy1ujwrvfwuoelo5xlf9kf.mp3","text":"......嗯？要出发了吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_272_strong/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:6/66/4ihcmhb5j72b74fcjvb3py16u1up3p5.mp3","text":"数量还不少。","alt":"voice_cn/char_272_strong/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:6/61/18lhyfoqzkv6iqjjpspqvm7r6lmxjju.mp3","text":"啊？","alt":"voice_cn/char_272_strong/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/8b/t2gayy48mz32k1dyl0v87bir66dgsp9.mp3","text":"在。","alt":"voice_cn/char_272_strong/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3b/j3p26cknp0ksrycyj6dx4uchuwmzwj7.mp3","text":"我试试。","alt":"voice_cn/char_272_strong/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/42/mq5heuy9efb89wk3328zqxkbq1nykgu.mp3","text":"呼......","alt":"voice_cn/char_272_strong/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:f/fc/d2vhsu47f8efdid2a923f4xd3o0lba0.mp3","text":"去鳞。","alt":"voice_cn/char_272_strong/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/6a/mstb62j6n6veofirll1e0w2yzcu0muh.mp3","text":"去内脏。","alt":"voice_cn/char_272_strong/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/6d/4lw1vx0t678jqjyqrwqypjotp5tgmek.mp3","text":"洗净。","alt":"voice_cn/char_272_strong/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/e7/gbgbgx2ajn943pp06ehpgiwh6lkx31o.mp3","text":"切块。","alt":"voice_cn/char_272_strong/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:2/25/phb4alj7fu6iuej4pmke7n9fx6v7y57.mp3","text":"老板，我们刚才，是不是干了一件不得了的事？","alt":"voice_cn/char_272_strong/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f5/3vnr3078zhgipsnt2hf5w1vbnrjyycc.mp3","text":"老板，这就......算完了吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_272_strong/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8f/pv023u1h7cxjw5fav6r6ulx1e2wwgr5.mp3","text":"老板，要追吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_272_strong/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:a/ab/5887p4i2240iiyp8o2u6eqp0udr0ecu.mp3","text":"老板，我觉得，跑路比较好。","alt":"voice_cn/char_272_strong/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:6/61/cfko66rxlzyexz535z4rzc52o084yxt.mp3","text":"不知道有没有适合摆摊的地方......","alt":"voice_cn/char_272_strong/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:b/ba/a2nq5j1bycubj7q4cp3jrb7edw7hgbz.mp3","text":"嗯？","alt":"voice_cn/char_272_strong/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:3/39/ismbf2m5k98w10f36qj4uqp1f69nigz.mp3","text":"不知道老板有没有忌口......","alt":"voice_cn/char_272_strong/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:5/52/jib9733i3bol3kkgixzcly41o2v1653.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_272_strong/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:0/05/dh42yr5likua006pc9le03l1y74cwxk.mp3","text":"之前要更晚收摊的日子，现在居然变成了假期，还有点不适应......老板，想吃点夜宵吗？其实我也有点饿了，我可以做两人份的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_272_strong/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:a/ae/oslrf6y35423fkvibjghgg58na95j4q.mp3","text":"老板，今天气色不错啊。","alt":"voice_cn/char_272_strong/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:3/35/0ywxgxir0j47j3trs5b1dvmuy0lx2nq.mp3","text":"老板，要我做点夜宵吗？","alt":"voice/char_272_strong/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d6/rixw7gvc6uco5bg1yqb8dbghh0xaim9.mp3","text":"老板，你要的。还有这个，你之前提过......大家都说我记忆力很好，不过我没什么感觉。","alt":"voice/char_272_strong/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c0/9smsnnudmavkl349erwjc2flag8r1ks.mp3","text":"我没事的时候，会研究厨艺......不止是海鲜。老板喜欢吃什么吗？","alt":"voice/char_272_strong/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/ac/afoi1c4cpbj19ib5sjz90mrmfyhnbs9.mp3","text":"......老板，难道说，一般需要由我来找话题吗？","alt":"voice/char_272_strong/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:7/77/8y3hls4nyiuybe45v9uwz5x3au1jeb8.mp3","text":"老板，你要去龙门夜市的话，我可以带路。那里很热闹，就是不太安全。","alt":"voice/char_272_strong/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/80/am37cqcnotb5m9kzdv3gtlhcoo17yu0.mp3","text":"凯尔希大姐特别允许我用罗德岛的渠道来进货，可以尝试一些新东西。老板，有什么特别的要求吗？","alt":"voice/char_272_strong/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b1/toeig9hjx8f79z0joapfkrpsvtvw4zq.mp3","text":"过去，因为一点原因，我一直被星熊警官盯着......不过，我知道，她和街坊的叔叔婶婶们一样，都是真心为我好。","alt":"voice/char_272_strong/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bw